; output_slot_out_of_range: OUTPUT to a slot beyond the allocated count
; must raise on both implementations.
;
; inputs.json allocates 4 slots; this writes slot 8. The Rust VM already
; raised OutputIndex; xqvm_py stored outputs in an unbounded dict and
; completed silently, so a program that wrote past its allocation looked
; fine on the oracle and failed on the VM that matters.

PUSH 42
STOW r0
PUSH 8
OUTPUT r0
HALT
